## Context

PR #278 (branch worktree-reactive-prancing-shell) delivers the v3 iteration
of the incremental-vs-global fusion prototype (`src/aedist/prototype_v1_fusion.py`).

Earlier commits referenced ticket 0076 (LangChain Deep Agents spike) by mistake;
this ticket retroactively owns the fusion v3 work.

## Work delivered (PR #278)

- **`--sweep` wiring**: two-pass argparse loads `seed`, `provider`, `model`,
  `corpus`, `reference`, `output`, `mode`, `format`, `fragments` from
  `experiments.toml` sweep configs via `p.set_defaults`.
- **Determinism**: `seed = 42` + `provider` pinning propagated to all 4 cells
  ({global, incremental} × {json, md}) via `api_kw` dict.
- **`query_model` dispatcher** added to `harness.py`: routes to
  `query_ollama_native` (sets `num_ctx`) for local models (no "/" in ID),
  `query_single_turn` for cloud models.
- **Prompt externalization**: 7 prompt files moved to
  `experiments/prompts/fusion_*.txt`.
- **Reference caching**: `load_plants_csv` called once before cell loop.
- **`experiments.toml`**: `seed = 42` added to all 53 sweeps; `[sweeps.fusion]`
  and `[sweeps.fusion_dev]` added.
- **Test suite**: `test_sweep_count` synced to full current sweep inventory;
  fusion and verification-variant sweeps exempted from standard-field check.

## Variance finding

DeepSeek V3.2 (671B MoE) remains non-deterministic even with seed=42 +
provider pinning (Alibaba). prompt_tokens are identical; completion_tokens
vary wildly (2308/3237/5443). Root cause: MoE tensor parallelism, not code.
`repeat = 3` remains necessary for cloud MoE models.

## Exit criteria (met)

- All 4 cells receive `**api_kw` (seed + provider). ✓
- `--sweep` loads from TOML. ✓
- `query_model` dispatcher in harness.py, no duplicate Ollama handling. ✓
- 26 unit tests pass. ✓
- `test_sweep_count` passes. ✓
